    "sections": {
        "description": "FSE Church Lite Theme is a full-site editing theme built with a block-based layout system. It provides templates, template parts, and block patterns that can be customized through the site editor. Churches can use its page structure to organize information such as worship schedules, announcements, events, ministries, and contact details. The theme includes editable sections for arranging text, images, buttons, navigation, and other content elements. Religious organizations can adjust layouts and visual settings to maintain a consistent appearance across different pages. Its template-based structure can also be used to present information about services, activities, and community programs. Christian ministries may use dedicated pages to describe their programs, missions, and upcoming activities. The theme allows church communities to modify content sections without directly editing theme files. Pages can include information about places of worship, service times, events, and related resources. FSE Church Lite can also accommodate faith-based organizations that need a structured website for sharing updates and resources. Site-wide settings provide options for adjusting typography, colors, navigation, and other design elements. The theme's focus on full-site editing makes its layouts and reusable components configurable from a centralized editing interface."
    },
